{"strongs": "H2387", "word": "חֵזִיר", "translit": "che.zir", "root": "חזר", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "pomegranate", "definition": "חֵזִיר proper name, masculine (compare inscription in RA 1867, plural 7 , Dr Sm xxiii ; Nö ZMG 1886, 162 'pointing — ֵ֯ to avoid offence;' but Nbr Acad. 1887, Dec. 17 compare Talmud & ᵑ7 ( חַזּוּרָא , חֵיזוּר , חֲזוּרָא etc.) pomegranate (and apple ; Syriac , ), compare בְּנֵי רִמּוֺן 2Sam 4:2 ; 2Sam 4:5 ; 2Sam 4:9 ) — 1. a priest of 17th course (assigned to David's time) 1Chr 24:15 ᵐ5 Χηξειν (16th, v 1Chr 24:14 ), but A Ιεξειρ, ᵐ5 L Χηξειρ. 2. one of those sealed Neh 10:21 ᵐ5 Ηξειρ, ᵐ5 L Αξηρ.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2692')\">BDB2692</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2387')\">H2387</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2691')\">BDB2691</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2693')\">BDB2693</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חֵזִיר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (compare inscription in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RA')\">RA<sup>1867, plural 7</sup></lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>Sm xxiii</sup></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>ZMG 1886, 162 'pointing</sup></lookup> — <bdbheb>ֵ֯</bdbheb> to avoid offence;' but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nbr')\">Nbr<sup>Acad. 1887, Dec. 17</sup></lookup> compare Talmud &amp; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> (<bdbheb>חַזּוּרָא</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חֵיזוּר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חֲזוּרָא</bdbheb> etc.) <highlight>pomegranate</highlight> (and <highlight>apple</highlight>; Syriac <placeholder1713/>, <placeholder1714/>), compare <bdbheb>בְּנֵי רִמּוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,4,2)\">2Sam 4:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,4,5)\">2Sam 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\"